title: IntroEntrance
---
Lorina: Ow-

Lorina: …Where am I?

The White Rabbit: There’s no time! We must go!

Lorina: What?! Go where?!

Lorina: Wait– why is the rabbit talking?!!

The White Rabbit: All rabbits can talk in Wonderland. But we simply do not have time for this.

The White Rabbit: Alice is in danger, great, great danger.

Lorina: How do you know abouot alice? What do you mean she’s in danger?

The White Rabbit: She was captured by the Queen, and she is a volatile woman.

The White Rabbit: Your sister will be executed if we don’t hurry!

The White Rabbit: The entrance to the queen’s entrance is just ahead– enter the gate and fetch your sister, and then you’ll both be able to return home.

The White Rabbit: But heed my words and be careful.

===
